{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "e9c3c69ea57c3fac8327817629a065f2e27df981769e42f4cca565df372b795c", "ja": "いつになったら完成するんだろう？　夢の中の衣装。\n夢占いだと、どんな意味なのかなぁ……？", "zh": "究竟什么时候才能完成呢？梦里的那件服装。\n要是用解梦来看，会是什么意思呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d3d9fa3ad63f0133bf608bf8c09bab5f2c2bde9658555a3d32d79c18710c1396", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\n何か、おかしなことでもあったんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n是发生什么奇怪的事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "21029a640e12f1cb4c0603be62eaacbc14ced1bf2e5d4c8a6e5f0fdb47a18a78", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　お疲れ様です。\nその、ちょっと不思議な夢を見たので。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！辛苦了。\n那个，因为我做了个有点不可思议的梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "e39928a3712b39e5acc23408807b2178579e4c47b2bcfd737cb839be440660ca", "ja": "大した話じゃないんですけど……えへへ。\n{$P$}さんは最近、夢を見ましたか？", "zh": "也不是什么大不了的事啦……嘿嘿。\n{$P$}先生最近做过梦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "56250a324c170466d6d0dc5d6700243c12548ea1b8a2595f651376d1c7f48d1f", "ja": "そうですね。大体は起きたら忘れちゃうんですけど……\n一つだけ、強烈に覚えている夢があって。", "zh": "是啊。大多醒来后就忘掉了，不过……\n有一个梦，我记得特别清楚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "759b7eafa6dca241c8296b05cff9459f7656e684cafa90fc8a40b922365274ae", "ja": "わあ～。どんな夢ですか？　ライブが成功した夢とか\n大きなお仕事を取った夢、とかですか？", "zh": "哇～。是什么样的梦呀？是演出成功的梦，\n还是接到了大工作的梦之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b81ce3b6cd41a0ed98bd244aae8da3178e6120b88df5ae9ac1f15b74c6606e9b", "ja": "違うんです。それが……。", "zh": "不是的。是那样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c8f87aaf48227bd6b6b417b28d8ea8ec33e8597bc4f375af4ed23ca6aa5a3998", "ja": "寝坊して、現場に大遅刻！　スタッフさん達に\nご迷惑をおかけして、社長にも怒られる夢です……。", "zh": "睡过头，导致去现场严重迟到了！给工作人员们\n添了很大的麻烦，还被社长狠狠训斥了一顿的梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "7eaa040f1a99d232877c0684621c42ce82eca7db05e4afa9fecd8c53e769f015", "ja": "ひゃ～……他人ごととは思えない……！\n正夢にならないように、お互い気をつけましょうね！", "zh": "呀～……真让人觉得感同身受……！\n为了不让它变成预知梦，我们彼此都要小心点哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1009_se", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9cefc6f973a331c1268a87605b8b5333e54ea9bed53cc93ba8ffb597fac24013", "ja": "あれっ！？　社長からメールだ、ええと……\n『手が空いていたら事務所に来てくれ。話がある』。", "zh": "咦！？是社长发来的邮件，我看看……\n“如果有空就来一趟事务所。有事找你”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "b97dceaa56fb85b311c2a5e429f71a500061cc7772cf50e2c5890393e438a6af", "ja": "ええっ！？　社長さんからって……\nもしかして{$P$}さん、正夢……？", "zh": "诶！？社长先生发来的……难道说，{$P$}先生，是预知梦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6a0d9d5c277eecc6f45d53065a09853393ebb1a0c81a5be4681bb0c3bb1c478f", "ja": "遅刻した記憶はないんだけどな……。\nと、とりあえず、行ってきますね。", "zh": "我不记得自己迟到过啊……总、总之，我先走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "a19f1d40f9059916046dec210863533087d40495b0dbbdf2b360a1632c1aa04e", "ja": "はーい、行ってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "好——路上小心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "be57033b30949103d9b0dceb70fb8320b5a08b4010cfb3ea35e4723206206b3c", "ja": "お疲れ様です、社長！　音無さんも。\nあの、今日は……？", "zh": "辛苦了，社长！音无小姐也是。\n那个，今天是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "f3bc5f32149022228099d954be76d756af1993259611b8edfb19a2233b7010b6", "ja": "やあ君、よく来てくれた！　急にすまない。\n実は今、例のドラマについての話が進みそうなんだ。", "zh": "呀，你来啦！这么急叫你过来真是不好意思。\n其实关于之前那部电视剧的事，现在好像有进展了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f6d2d841960317b1ae12164eb04b6414d69e2f5c96afb35e67525a05e3af3fbd", "ja": "例の……ああ、BOTシリーズ連動の、\n『ヘキサ・アカデミクス』のことですか？", "zh": "那个……啊，是指与BOT系列联动的《ヘキサ・アカデミクス》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "191b934012f7306d831fd023a4e67d908166c05206c9d3f0a741b3d046df1c44", "ja": "うむ！　こういうのはタイミングがあるからね。\n関係各所と話す前に、君の話を聞こうと思ったんだ。", "zh": "嗯！这种事也是要看时机的。\n所以在和相关各方商谈之前，我想先听听你的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "530ca2b626fe99c9533749606a7ff9f915e6644cdb2376f37a716af1ffb6e389", "ja": "ふふ、社長ったら「あのドラマ、続きが\n気になるね！」って、ずっと言ってたんですよ。", "zh": "呵呵，社长他一直在说：“那部电视剧，真让人在意后续发展呢！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "d4b5c90294feaa311aaf3cdf0d13e3f82202487675500833267bba626da286b1", "ja": "自分が早く聞きたかったから、\n{$P$}さんを呼び出したんじゃ？", "zh": "该不会是因为自己想早点听到，所以才把{$P$}先生叫来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "9023ccb61395f2eb559bb6859895926d426743fa3897c897263085a90d08d395", "ja": "そうそう、ずっと気になって……って、音無君！\nそんな公私混同はしないよ、まったく。", "zh": "对了对了，我一直很在意……等等，音无君！我才不会把公事和私事混为一谈呢，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "82f790e047a57e07ae61ff6f33aeb3ab0e496a9207b025e00a71a60619ce5cc4", "ja": "そういう事でしたか！　安心しました。\nそれじゃ早速……今から打ち合わせしてもいいですか？", "zh": "原来是这样！这下我就放心了。\n那么马上……现在可以开个会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "adc388de5777aa88f3ddd78c181bd63d4d0eae99af76b8625512b171650b700d", "ja": "それで{$P$}さん、\n続きはどんなお話になるんですか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，\n接下来会是什么样的故事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "75135a2919b214fe608982df39f6db6df6ca4e50817e08c52d78c70961ddcf9f", "ja": "音無君！？　私より先に聞き出そうとするなんて、\n抜け駆けはズルいんじゃないかね。", "zh": "音无！？居然想抢在我之前问出来，\n抢跑可不太好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "01feec23fb866c07f60f9a16c7cdef49bc271a7467f149a68ec0f3aaba35db5a", "ja": "だって、私も気になっていたんです～！", "zh": "因为我也一直很在意嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "335f715a5be84399073a93e1db69bf91f2a917f04d0d1f65add4ba1776a3e4e8", "ja": "はは、そんなに期待してもらえるとありがたいですね。\nええと、今企画書のデータを……。", "zh": "哈哈，能让您如此期待，我很感激。\n那个，我现在正在处理企划书的数据……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "3f0f7976eca35130ecba601e32537ca0d7187f7378eaa8732167c4997c974592", "ja": "前のお話はプリンセスとエンジェルのメンバーが\n出演しましたよね？　ということは……？", "zh": "上次是公主和天使组的成员出演的吧？这么说来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "07125f20c5bd3d33c8a53c827e06c57954acedccc13e91f088742cc525896ace", "ja": "やはり、残りのフェアリーが主軸になると見た！\nどうだね君、当たっているんじゃないかね？", "zh": "果然，我看剩下的Fairy会成为主力！\n你觉得呢，我是不是猜中了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "87c02a9ad6cbeccc595bb5ae45d8e9166ba7a5fe97f12cff25f2c9f8f738180d", "ja": "食いつきがすごい……\nそうですね、フェアリーのメンバーの話になります。", "zh": "反应真激烈……是的，接下来会讲妖精组成员的故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d589583703149bd2b243975e0ac682350a3bafa89a6b521bc9625980fced6ab3", "ja": "最初は、陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）のシーン。\nベテランの千早と、新人の静香の戦いから始まります。", "zh": "首先是陰界戦戯（シャドウバウト）的场景。\n从老将千早与新人静香的对决开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "0cfaf99e2c4fcea9bfd7fbf498b8680e33fe2bef7980541c8fa08ec380dfb4e0", "ja": "そして客席には、陰界の謎に迫ろうとする\n新聞部員、ロコの姿が……。", "zh": "而在观众席上，还能看到试图探寻阴界之谜的新闻部成员——ROCO……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
